<BaseLayout title="About Me | Flippermen">
  <div class="cv-container">
  
    <div class="cv-header">
      <h1>Esteban Jimenez</h1>
      <div class="subtitle">Ing. Ciberseguridad</div>
      <div class="contact-info">
        <span>(+593) 0981413104</span>
        <span><a href="mailto:tu-email@ejemplo.com">esteban@ejemplo.com</a></span>
        <span><a href="https://linkedin.com/in/esteban-jimenez-994868249/" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a></span>
        <span><a href="https://mrflippermen.github.io/" target="_blank">Portfolio</a></span>
      </div>
      <p style="margin-top: 1.5rem; max-width: 800px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; color: var(--color-text);">
        Cybersecurity Engineering student (in progress) and teaching assistant at Universidad de las Américas. 
        Independent pentester specialized in Red Team, with real experience on HackerOne. 
        Creator of scripts for Flipper Zero and awareness talks. Ranked top 1 in Ecuador and 55th worldwide on Hack The Box. 
        Captain of the Ecuador team in Latin America Cybersecurity 2025 (Colombia).
